  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往法兰城与万圣节活动员（117.84）对话，选“是”获得【万圣夜糖果包】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "2.前往伊尔村与万圣夜工作员（57.52）对话，获得【伊尔村回执单】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "3.前往圣拉鲁卡村与万圣夜工作员（61.88）对话，获得【圣拉鲁卡村回执单】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "4.前往亚留特村与万圣夜工作员（32.38）对话，获得【亚留特村回执单】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "5.返回法兰城与万圣节活动员对话，交出【万圣夜糖果包】、【伊尔村回执单】、【圣拉鲁卡村回执单】、【亚留特村回执单】获得【万圣夜奖励包】、【训练介绍信】。",
      "type": "combined-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "◆丢弃【训练介绍信】后与万圣节活动员对话，选“是”可再次获得【万圣夜糖果包】",
      "type": "restart-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "◆双击【万圣夜奖励包】随机获得【奖品】：",
      "type": "container-use",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "名称作用",
      "type": "table-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "手工糖果回复25点生命",
      "type": "reward-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "南瓜汁回复50点魔力",
      "type": "reward-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "浓缩糖浆回复50点生命",
      "type": "reward-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "十夫长变身卡造型变更为十夫长（绿UD）",
      "type": "reward-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "百夫长变身卡造型变更为百夫长（蓝UD）",
      "type": "reward-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "千夫长变身卡造型变更为千夫长（红UD）",
      "type": "reward-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "无头将军变身卡造型变更为无头将军（黄UD）",
      "type": "reward-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "南瓜头Lv.4头饰、耐久100；防御+5、精神+4、闪躲+5、生命+100、魔力+100、魅力+5；装备后显示外观",
      "type": "reward-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "6.持有【训练介绍信】与警备队长（119.84）对话。（此步可跳过）",
      "type": "optional-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "7.前往阿巴尼斯村，出村至莎莲娜岛（280.140）处。夜晚，持有【训练介绍信】与警戒的魔物对话，传送至？？？。",
      "type": "timed-held-item-teleport",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "8.通过（8.7）处红色传送石，抵达潜藏的洞穴。",
      "type": "maze-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "◆潜藏的洞穴为随机迷宫，共9层；魔物为Lv.49~59阴影、火焰之刃；迷宫中会随机遭遇游荡的千夫长",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "9.通过随机迷宫抵达？？？，与百夫长领队（31.7）对话，进入战斗。",
      "type": "battle-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "◆战斗信息：",
      "type": "battle-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "Lv.60百夫长领队，血量约10000，不抗咒；技能：攻击、防御、崩击、乾坤一掷、气功弹",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        23
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "Lv.60十夫长*4，血量约4000，不抗咒；技能：攻击、冰冻魔法、火焰魔法",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        24
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "10.战斗胜利后与百夫长领队（53.7）对话，获得【部队长南瓜头】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        25
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "11.返回法兰城与警备队长对话，交出【部队长南瓜头】获得【无头骑士的项链】，任务完结。",
      "type": "completion-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        26
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "text": "◆【训练介绍信】不会交出，可直接从第7步开始完成后续任务",
      "type": "item-retention",
      "sourceLines": [
        27
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "text": "◆无头的骑士项链（攻）：Lv.4项链、耐久12；攻击+31、必杀+14、命中+17、生命+50、魔力+50、抗魔+27；数值浮动、可以交易；装备后获得称号“神圣的降魔者”",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        28
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "text": "◆无头的骑士项链（魔）：Lv.4项链、耐久12；防御+34、敏捷+11、精神+28、闪躲+13、生命+50、魔力+50；数值浮动、可以交易；装备后获得称号“幽灵盛典”",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        29
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    }
